{
  "fps": 24,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "audioFile": "madman/audio/suspense-v5.wav",
  "durationInFrames": 4770,
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "section": "",
      "from": 0,
      "duration": 96,
      "cues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moon",
      "section": "一",
      "from": 96,
      "duration": 354,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "moon",
          "text": "今天晚上，很好的月光。",
          "from": 18,
          "audioFrames": 81,
          "duration": 89
        },
        {
          "id": "dog",
          "text": "然而须十分小心。不然，那赵家的狗，何以看我两眼呢？",
          "from": 135,
          "audioFrames": 182,
          "duration": 190
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "street",
      "section": "二",
      "from": 450,
      "duration": 666,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "zhao",
          "text": "早上小心出门，赵贵翁的眼色便怪：似乎怕我，似乎想害我。",
          "from": 16,
          "audioFrames": 220,
          "duration": 228
        },
        {
          "id": "whisper",
          "text": "还有七八个人，交头接耳的议论我。又怕我看见。",
          "from": 262,
          "audioFrames": 148,
          "duration": 156
        },
        {
          "id": "smile",
          "text": "其中最凶的一个人，张着嘴，对我笑了一笑；我便从头直冷到脚跟。",
          "from": 436,
          "audioFrames": 198,
          "duration": 206
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "door",
      "section": "三",
      "from": 1116,
      "duration": 246,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "lock",
          "text": "陈老五赶上前，硬把我拖回家中了。进了书房，便反扣上门，宛然是关了一只鸡鸭。",
          "from": 12,
          "audioFrames": 192,
          "duration": 200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "history",
      "section": "三",
      "from": 1362,
      "duration": 522,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "history-a",
          "text": "我翻开历史一查，这历史没有年代，",
          "from": 14,
          "audioFrames": 101,
          "duration": 109
        },
        {
          "id": "history-b",
          "text": "歪歪斜斜的每叶上都写着“仁义道德”几个字。",
          "from": 136,
          "audioFrames": 130,
          "duration": 138
        },
        {
          "id": "history-c",
          "text": "我横竖睡不着，仔细看了半夜，才从字缝里看出字来，满本都写着两个字是“吃人”！",
          "from": 287,
          "audioFrames": 194,
          "duration": 202
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "meal",
      "section": "四",
      "from": 1884,
      "duration": 312,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "fish",
          "text": "陈老五送进饭来，一碗菜，一碗蒸鱼；这鱼的眼睛，白而且硬，张着嘴，同那一伙想吃人的人一样。",
          "from": 14,
          "audioFrames": 263,
          "duration": 271
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "consult",
      "section": "四",
      "from": 2196,
      "duration": 534,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "brother",
          "text": "大哥说：“今天请何先生来，给你诊一诊。”我说：“可以！”",
          "from": 14,
          "audioFrames": 150,
          "duration": 158
        },
        {
          "id": "doctor",
          "text": "老头子坐着，闭了眼睛，摸了好一会，呆了好一会；便张开他鬼眼睛说：“不要乱想。静静的养几天，就好了。”",
          "from": 197,
          "audioFrames": 297,
          "duration": 305
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "aside",
      "section": "四",
      "from": 2730,
      "duration": 234,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "aside",
          "text": "老头子跨出门，走不多远，便低声对大哥说道，“赶紧吃罢！”大哥点点头。",
          "from": 17,
          "audioFrames": 168,
          "duration": 176
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "question",
      "section": "八",
      "from": 2964,
      "duration": 138,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "question",
          "text": "从来如此，便对么？",
          "from": 19,
          "audioFrames": 61,
          "duration": 69
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "named",
      "section": "十",
      "from": 3102,
      "duration": 318,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "madman-name",
          "text": "“都出去！疯子有什么好看！”",
          "from": 12,
          "audioFrames": 61,
          "duration": 69
        },
        {
          "id": "label",
          "text": "他们岂但不肯改，而且早已布置；预备下一个疯子的名目罩上我。",
          "from": 100,
          "audioFrames": 184,
          "duration": 192
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "beams",
      "section": "十",
      "from": 3420,
      "duration": 360,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "beams",
          "text": "横梁和椽子都在头上发抖；抖了一会，就大起来，堆在我身上。",
          "from": 12,
          "audioFrames": 150,
          "duration": 158
        },
        {
          "id": "false-weight",
          "text": "我晓得他的沉重是假的，便挣扎出来，出了一身汗。",
          "from": 190,
          "audioFrames": 117,
          "duration": 125
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "self",
      "section": "十二",
      "from": 3780,
      "duration": 252,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "self-a",
          "text": "四千年来时时吃人的地方，",
          "from": 14,
          "audioFrames": 69,
          "duration": 77
        },
        {
          "id": "self-b",
          "text": "今天才明白，我也在其中混了多年；",
          "from": 108,
          "audioFrames": 107,
          "duration": 115
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "children",
      "section": "十三",
      "from": 4032,
      "duration": 282,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "children",
          "text": "没有吃过人的孩子，或者还有？",
          "from": 24,
          "audioFrames": 99,
          "duration": 107
        },
        {
          "id": "plea",
          "text": "救救孩子……",
          "from": 179,
          "audioFrames": 41,
          "duration": 49
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "epilogue",
      "section": "小序 · 兄长转述",
      "from": 4314,
      "duration": 264,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "cured",
          "text": "劳君远道来视，然已早愈，赴某地候补矣。",
          "from": 48,
          "audioFrames": 124,
          "duration": 132
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "section": "改编设问",
      "from": 4578,
      "duration": 192,
      "cues": []
    }
  ],
